  "name": "Question 10",
  "problem": "Let $D=EF.$ What is the value of ${d}_{23}$, if\n\n$$\nE=[\\begin{aligned}-2 & 1 \\\\ -4 & 3 \\\\ 6 & 1\\end{aligned}],\\,F=[\\begin{aligned}2 & 1 & -5 & 3 \\\\ -1 & 0 & -2 & -1\\end{aligned}]?\n$$",
  "worked_solution": "Multiplying the $2$nd row in $E$ by the $3$rd column in $F$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{d}_{23} & =[\\begin{aligned}-2 & 1 \\\\ -4 & 3 \\\\ 6 & 1\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}2 & 1 & -5 & 3 \\\\ -1 & 0 & -2 & -1\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}-4 & 3\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}-5 \\\\ -2\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =(-4)\\cdot (-5)+3\\cdot (-2) \\\\  & =20-6 \\\\  & =14.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
